2 TITL Wilhelmina Brandt Book  Benkestok Family P 24
3 CONT This Chart in the Wilhelmina Brandt Book, page 24 show that Anna Jonsdtr Haar who died 27 Nov 1569 was married to Trond Benkestok who was born c. 1490 and died 14 Feb 1558.  
3 CONT 
3 CONT It shows Trond Benkestok as the son of Tord Benkestok and Sigrid Urup.
3 CONT 
3 CONT It shows Trond and Anna's son as Jon Benkestok who is married to Birgitte Nielsdtr who are the parents of Margarethe Benkestok.  
3 CONT 
3 CONT Margarethe married Christen Aalborg.
