1 DEAT
2 DATE 1214
2 PLAC Bergen, Norway
3 MAP
4 LATI 60.3587
4 LONG 5.4049
2 NOTE @NFS1137@
1 EVEN
2 TYPE BIOGRAPHY
2 NOTE Description: Håkon Galen Folkvidsson, also known as Haakon the Crazy, was a Norwegian jarl (earl) and Birkebeiner chieftain during the Norwegian civil war era. His epithet "Galen" translates to "the Mad", but it likely referred to his ferocity i
3 CONC n battle rather than actual madness
