2 TITL Slektene Velde og Espeland og inngiftede slekter p.197
3 CONT Gaute Ivarsson in Valen is mentioned in 1512 and onwards, but must have died around 1550. We do not know who he was married to, but we know of 7 children, namely 1) Jon Gauteson to Sveen, 2) Gudrun, married to Nils Clausson, magistrate in Stavanger
3 CONC , whose son Christoffer Nilsson was also magistrate. (He is mentioned in the process about Opsal in Vikedal), 3) Inger, married to Sverke Jonsson (Theiste?), 4) a daughter was married to Nils Jensson of Semeleng in Valdres. He belonged to the Losna
3 CONC ætten and was magistrate in Stavanger, 5) Ivar Gauteson, married to Anna Jakobsdatter. They both died before 1578. They had two daughters, Sunniva Ivarsdatter, who was married to Torkel Oma (see about them later) and Karen Ivarsdatter, married t
3 CONC o 1) Mikkel, 2) Steffen Erikson Loss. 6) Laurits Gauteson, married to Gyrid Jakobsdatter and 7) Torbjørn Gauteson at Fimreite in Sogn.
3 CONT 
3 CONT Sunniva lvarsdatter comes through Linga, Handagard and Brattabø into our family. Furthermore, we must be able to assume, as mentioned below, that Jon Gauteson's son, Mads Jonson, has his daughter Herborg (Madsdatter) up-
3 CONT 
