0 @NFS117@ NOTE Aspa
1 CONT Aspøya, Straumsnes, Møre og Romsdal is an Island. Aspa is the collective name of both the farm and the group of interrelated Norwegian families of noble origins in Møre og Romsdal, a fylke in southwestern Norway. Several members of this group pl
1 CONC ayed significant roles in the political and ecclesiastical history of Norway in the Middle Ages. The group's name comes from its origin, the two farms on the island of Aspøya in the present municipality of Tingvoll, also in Møre og Romsdal – As
1 CONC pa and Boksaspa.
