1 CONT "The family's ancestor Knut was married to Kristina Bengtsdotter, daughter of the lawman in Västergötland Bengt Hafridsson. She owned land in Fuxerna parish, Flundre county, Västergötland and was still alive in 1345."
1 CONT 
