0 @NFS302@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT "Jon Knutsson (son av Knut Jonsson, tab. 3). Uppträder första gången 17.5 1335. Blev riddare något av åren 1338—1342. Var 1344 häradshövding i Göstrings hd i Östergötland och 1352 häradshövding i Vedbo hd i Småland. Utfärdade 1350 o
1 CONC ch 1356 brev från Aspenäs. Förekommer sista gången 6.1 1357. Var sannolikt död 27.10 1359. Ärvde efter fadern jord i Dals hd i Östergötland. Var redan 31.10 1338 gift med Helena Laurensdotter, dotter av riddaren, riksrådet och södermanlan
1 CONC dslagmannen Laurens Ulfsson (Ama) och hans hustru Ingrid Anundsdotter. Fru Helena levde ännu 27.10 1359." 
1 CONT 
1 CONT "Jon Knutsson (son of Knut Jonsson, tab. 3). Appears for the first time on 17.5 1335. Was knighted sometime between 1338 and 1342. Was in 1344 district chief of Göstrings district in Östergötland and 1352 district chief of Vedbo district in Små
1 CONC land. Issued in 1350 and 1356 letter from Aspenäs. Appears for the last time on 6.1 1357. Was probably dead on 27.10. 1359. Inherited from his father land in Dals hd in Östergötland. Was already married on 31.10. 1338 to Helena Laurensdotter, da
1 CONC ughter of the knight, councilor and Södermanland lawman Laurens Ulfsson (Ama) and his wife Ingrid Anundsdotter. Mrs. Helena was still alive on 27 October 1359."
1 CONT 
1 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Aspen%C3%A4s%C3%A4tten#TAB_5
