1 CONT 
1 CONT "Was married in 1291 to Margareta Ulfsdotter, who is mentioned as dead in 1341, daughter of the knight Ulf Karlsson (Ulv) and his wife, possibly a daughter of the lawman Karl Ingeborgasson (Lejonbalk)."
1 CONT 
