1 CONT Dear John, I have done my own genealogical research, and this is the correct form for Medieval Norway. Patronymics are not surnames.  
1 CONT In medieval Norway, people did not use fixed family surnames. The correct historical form is [Given name] + Håkonsdatter/Håkonsson, which belongs in the First Names field. The Last Name field should remain blank.
