0 @NFS1041@ NOTE provides historical-based discussion of Gaut's connection to Ornes and the famous Urnes Stavkirke; along with substantial research by Hallvard Magerøy, confirms the founding of the Ornes family, revising the old theory about 'Gaut på Æne
