0 @NFS1172@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT b)         KNUT Birgersson (-killed in battle Lena 31 Jan 1208).  Snorre names (in order) "Earl Philip, Earl Knut, Folke and Magnus" as the four sons of "Earl Birger Brose" & his wife[21].  Jarl in Sweden.  m ---.  The name of Knut´s wife is not k
1 CONC nown.  Knut & his wife had two children: 
1 CONT 
1 CONT i)          CECILIA Knutsdotter (-bur Vårfruberga Abbey).  m FILIP Birgersson [Aspenäsätten] (-before 1279, bur Vårfruberga Abbey).
1 CONT 
1 CONT ii)         MAGNUS Knutsson "Broka" .  1230.  m as her second husband, [KATARINA] Eriksdatter of Sweden, widow of PETER [Larsson], daughter of ERIK Knutsson King of Sweden & his first wife ---.  Magnus & his wife had one child: 
1 CONT 
1 CONT (a)       KNUT Magnusson (-murdered [Herrevadsbro] 1251). 
1 CONT 
1 CONT Earl Knut , died 31 January 1208 , was a Swedish earl , and son of Birger Brosa . Knut who was king Erik Knutsson 's earl fell in 1208 in the battle of Lena .
1 CONT 
1 CONT Son till Birger Brosa.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Knut Birgersson skall ha varit jarl för Sverige 1206-1208. Stupade i slaget vid Lena.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Slaget vid Lena stod mellan kungasonen Erik Knutsson med svenskt och norskt krigsfolk och kung Sverker den yngre med en till övervägande del dansk här vid Lena i Kungslena socken i nuvarande Tidaholms kommun, Västergötland, den 31 januari 1208
1 CONC .[1]
1 CONT 
1 CONT Son of Birger Brosa.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Knut Birgersson must have been Earl of Sweden 1206-1208. Died in the Battle of Lena.
1 CONT 
1 CONT The Battle of Lena was between the king's son Erik Knutsson with Swedish and Norwegian warriors and King Sverker the Younger with a predominantly Danish army at Lena in Kungslena parish in present-day Tidaholm municipality, Västergötland, on Janu
1 CONC ary 31, 1208.[1]
1 CONT 
1 CONT Sources
1 CONT ↑ Swedish Wikipedia, Battle of Lenaid=592 No REPO record found with id R-2142377610.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Sources
1 CONT ↑ Svenska Wikipedia, Slaget vid Lena
1 CONT 
1 CONT Children 
1 CONT Magnus Broka
1 CONT Cecilia Knutsdotter (Bjälboätten), married to Filip Birgersson of Aspenäsätten
