0 @NFS1301@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT "Knut Bengtsson (son av Bengt Jonsson, tab. 6). Skrev sig till Sundby i Kärnbo sn i Selebo hd i Södermanland 25.1 1392. Nämnes såsom häradshövding i öknebo hd i Södermanland 1400—1407. Levde ännu 2.4 1419. Begrovs 26.9 1420 i Vadstena kl
1 CONC oster. Var gift först efter all sannolikhet redan 20.2 1402 med Sofia Gertsdotter, dotter av riddaren Gerhard Snakenborg och Kristina Bengtsdotter (Bielke), och sedan med Birgitta Bengtsdotter, som 25.6 1420 begrovs i Vadstena kloster."
1 CONT 
1 CONT "Knut Bengtsson (son of Bengt Jonsson, tab. 6). Wrote himself to Sundby in Kärnbo sn in Selebo hd in Södermanland 25.1 1392. Mentioned as county chief in Öknebo hd in Södermanland 1400—1407. Still alive 2.4 1419. Buried 26.9 1420 in Vadsten
1 CONC a monastery. Was first married, in all probability already on 20.2 1402, to Sofia Gertsdotter, daughter of the knight Gerhard Snakenborg and Kristina Bengtsdotter (Bielke), and then to Birgitta Bengtsdotter, who was buried on 25.6 1420 in Vadsten
1 CONC a monastery."
1 CONT 
1 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Aspen%C3%A4s%C3%A4tten#TAB_8
