1 CONT "Det anses också vara troligt att Peter Näf var far till Margareta Petersdotter (vars sigill troligen bestod av ett lejon), gift med lagmannen Algot Brynolfsson (1270–1288), stamfar till Algotssönerna." 
1 CONT 
1 CONT "It is also considered likely that Peter Näf was the father of Margareta Petersdotter (whose seal probably consisted of a lion), married to the lawman Algot Brynolfsson (1270–1288), ancestor of the Algotssons."
1 CONT 
