0 @NFS1511@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT Haakon Haakonsson, Prince of Norway was born in 1232.1 He was the son of Haakon IV Haakonsson, King of Norway and Margareta Skulesdotter.1 He married Rixa Folkunga, daughter of Birgir Folkunga, Jarl of Sweden and Ingeborg Eriksdottir, in 1251.1 H
1 CONC e died in 1257.1
1 CONT      He gained the title of Prince Haakon of Norway.2 He held the office of Co-regent of Norway between 1240 and 1257.3
1 CONT Child of Haakon Haakonsson, Prince of Norway and Rixa Folkunga
1 CONT Sverre Magnus Haakonsson d. 1261
1 CONT Citations
1 CONT [S16] Jirí Louda and Michael MacLagan, Lines of Succession: Heraldry of the Royal Families of Europe, 2nd edition (London, U.K.: Little, Brown and Company, 1999), table 24. Hereinafter cited as Lines of Succession.
1 CONT [S16] Louda and MacLagan, Lines of Succession, table 27.
1 CONT [S38] John Morby, Dynasties of the World: a chronological and genealogical handbook (Oxford, Oxfordshire, U.K.: Oxford University Press, 1989), page 147. Hereinafter cited as Dynasties of the World.
