0 @NFS1575@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT "Karl Magnusson (son av Magnus Gregersson, tab. 3). Troligen identisk med den Karl Magnusson, som omtalas 1321, nämnes säkert 1328. Omtalas senast 15.7 1347. Enligt Utter blev han och brodern Johan ihjälslagna vid Nöteborg, tydligen under Magnu
1 CONC s Erikssons ryska krig. Ägde förutom gården Brunnsholm i Näs sn i Åsunda hd i Uppland bl. a. gods i Oppunda, Jön&kers och Västerrekarne hd i Södermanland, i Grimstens hd i Närke, och i Tveta hd i Småland. Var 1343, kanske redan 1339, gif
1 CONC t med Cecilia Birgersdotter, som levde 15.7 1347 och troligen var dotter av Birger Job (huvud) och hans hustru Margareta, möjligen en dotterdotter till Ragnhild Andersdotter (Elofssönernas ätt) och hennes förste man Lars av Snyttringe."
1 CONT 
1 CONT "Karl Magnusson (son of Magnus Gregersson, tab. 3). Probably identical to the Karl Magnusson, who is mentioned in 1321, certainly mentioned in 1328. Last mentioned on 15.7 1347. According to Utter, he and his brother Johan were killed at Nöteborg
1 CONC , apparently under Magnus Eriksson's Russian war. Owned, in addition to the estate Brunnsholm in Näs sn in Åsunda hd in Uppland, among other things, estates in Oppunda, Jön&kers and Västerrekarne hd in Södermanland, in Grimstens hd in Närke
1 CONC , and in Tveta hd in Småland. Was married in 1343, perhaps as early as 1339 with Cecilia Birgersdotter, who lived 15.7 1347 and was probably the daughter of Birger Job (head) and his wife Margareta, possibly a granddaughter of Ragnhild Andersdotte
1 CONC r (the Elofsson family) and her first husband Lars av Snyttringe."
1 CONT 
1 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Folkunga%C3%A4ttens_o%C3%A4kta_gren#TAB_6
