0 @NFS1937@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT "En dotter. Var 24.4 1301 gift med lagmannen i Södermanland och konung Birgers råd riddaren Filip Ingevaldsson (Örnsparre), vilken omtalas 1285—1318 och var död 28.5, troligen 1318."
1 CONT 
1 CONT "A daughter. On 24 April 1301, she was married to the lawman in Södermanland and king Birger's council knight Filip Ingevaldsson (Örnsparre), who is mentioned in 1285-1318 and died on 28 May, probably 1318."
1 CONT 
1 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Folkunga%C3%A4ttens_o%C3%A4kta_gren#TAB_1
