0 @NFS2080@ NOTE This record links the sons of Ture Kettilsson to their father and their mother Sigrid. I am adding a translation of the biography of each listed son as a memory.
0 @NFS2081@ NOTE Philippus Ulfsson (son of Ulf Karlsson, tab. 2). Mentioned at the earliest in 1296. Became a knight from the years 1296-1303 - ie dubbed either at King Birger's wedding in 1298 or at his coronation in 1302 - and no later than 1305 councilor
1 CONC , which he was still in 1322 and probably still in 1333. Stated to have lived in "Langanaes", identified with Långnäs in Kettilstads sn, Kinda hd in Östergötland. Married first to a dotier or at least a close relative of the knight and councilo
1 CONC r Karl Gustavsson ( 2 crossed lilies of the valley ) and then to Gödelin Gotskalksdotter, who owned land in Bobergs hd in Östergötland and still lived in 1341 and was the daughter of the knight Gotskalk van Kyren
1 CONT 
1 CONT Children:
1 CONT 
1 CONT 1. Ulf Philippusson, 1319—1350, knight. See tab. 4.
1 CONT 1. Karl Philippusson, 1320—1333, gunsmith. See tab. 9.
1 CONT 1. Johan Philippusson. Occurs no earlier than 1335. Studded as a knight between 13.4 and 13.12 1336, ie probably at King Magnus' coronation in July s.å .. Owned mother-inherited land in Vifolka hd in Östergötland. Died between 1336 and 1340. Hi
1 CONC s widow was 1340 Bengta Nilsdotter, possibly the daughter of the knight Nils Kettilsson ( Bielke ) and Bengta Algotsdotter ( Algot Jonsson's family ).
1 CONT 1. Ingrid Philippusdotter. Probably married first to Councilor Ragvald Magnusson ( Lejonbalk ), who is mentioned 1319-1322, and most recently in 1344 to the knight Karl Bengtsson ( oxhead ), who owned land in i.a. Kumla hd in Närke, Finspångalän
1 CONC s hd in Östergötland and Oppunda hd in Södermanland and died in 1350.
1 CONT 2. (?) Märta Philippusdotter. Received 9.5 1345 land in Faurås and Himle hd in Halland as a morning gift from Sigvid Trana , who became a knight between 1349 and 1352 and died at the earliest in 1352. Was married in 1362 to Mats Håkansson ( Berg
1 CONC kvaraätten ), who is mentioned no earlier than 1353, lived in Ulvsberg in Gammalkils sn , Valkebo hd in Östergötland and still lived 1393.
1 CONT 2. Eggard Philippusson. Only known through the tombstone, which was found in Gärdserum's church in Norra Tjusts hd in Småland.
1 CONT 2. Margareta Philippusdotter. Only known through tombstones in Gärdserum's church.
1 CONT 2. Magnus Philippusson. Stated to have lived 1341.
1 CONT 2. Bengt Philippusson, 1341-1381, knight, councilor, justitiarius. See tab. 11.
1 CONT 2. Erik Philippusson. Earliest mentioned 1341.
1 CONT 2. A daughter. Married to Karl Haraldsson ( Stubbe ) at Ålhult in Södra Vi sn, Sevede hd in Småland, identified with the 1330-1331 mentioned bailiff at Turku Castle, remarried to Cecilia Algotsdotter and died between 1331 and 1370.
