0 @NFS2100@ NOTE GUTTORM is my 18th great-grandfather. MARCIA LEE    BRATT is a title of nobility
0 @NFS2101@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT ØHerr Guttorm til Tom was living in 1291 on Tom, Råde. Mr. Guttorm was together with Rolv and Håvard Lang (and some clergy) present on Jarlsøy, Sem, on 16.03.1291, when Ogmund Toraldesson, priest at Lavranskirken in Tønsberg, donated part of U
1 CONC lleren on Røyse, Ringerike, to St. Halvardskirken in Oslo (DN II 29). In Østfold Historielag's journal, an attempt has been made to prove that the four latter persons are descended from Olav på Store-Dal, Skjeberg, who is mentioned in the roya
1 CONC l sagas approx. 1113 together with his children Håkon Fauke and Borghild (Magnus Blinde's mother), and from Håvård who lived on Dal in 1200. Herr Guttorm had died before 24.11.1299, when King Håkon Magnusson, who confiscated goods at this time
1 CONC , determined that the six markebol land (in Henni, Romerike?) which had been given to the priests' municipality at Mariakirken in Oslo and which Mr. Guttorm had owned, should always remain there. (DN II 55.)   MARCIA LEE
