0 @NFS2174@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT Summary: Agreement concluded in the presence of the Rigsraad between Bishop Arne af Bergen and Mrs. Katarina Ivarsdatter af Logalo, whereby the latter gets a free board in the Bishop's Garden in exchange for 20 months of food in Gaarden Nesheim i
1 CONC n Graven Parish, which her husband Mr. Gaut Gautssön had given her her. Her brother and heir Mr. Eystein gave his consent to this trade. Source: After Afskr. in Barth. IV. (E) 304-306 of a lost Bergen Codex. (Printed in Björgynjar Kalfskinn ed. M
1 CONC unch. p. 124-12 5.) Number: 82. Date: 10 April 1306. Place: Bergen. Letter text (from the printed edition): In nomine domini amen. Was this purchase and divorce agreement between Mr. Arna, with God's mercy, the bishop of Biorgvin and Mrs. Katrina
1 CONC r Jvarsdottor a Loghalo, that she should have a table in the bishop's guard in Biorgvin æ while she lives like this, as Mr. Bishop thinks prudently and his heir command .
