1 CONT Sept  25.  675.  Indenture  attesting  that  on  Friday  next  before  Michaelmas 1293,  the  following  articles  were  delivered  to  Sir  Odoenus  Uglacii and  Master  Weyland  de  Stiklawe  for  the  use  of  'the  most  serene lady '  Lady  Is
