0 @NFS2388@ NOTE 📜 Genealogical Note
1 CONT “-sson” = Swedish/Norse tradition.
1 CONT “-sen” = Danish/Norwegian tradition after 1537.
1 CONT This distinction is a key marker in Scandinavian genealogy, helping identify whether a record reflects Swedish or Danish/Norwegian influence.
1 CONT this means when you see Hvite Gulsvik families in Norway, their patronymics gradually shifted from -sson to -sen after Denmark’s takeover.
1 CONT MS Copilot AI 22 Nov. 2025
