0 @NFS2423@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT "Märta Ulfsdotter. Ägde jord i Vallentuna hd i Uppland. Hon följde sin andre man i landsflykt 1357, varför hennes gods indrogos och gåvos åt hennes son i första giftet Peter Ribbing. Hon var i Norge drottning Margaretas hovmästarinna. Gif
1 CONC t första gången senast 1341 med hövitsmannen över (södra) Halland Sigvid Ribbing, som levde 1336—1345, och andra gången senast 1355 med riddaren Knut Algotsson (Bengt Hafridssons ätt), som nämnes 1354—1394." 
1 CONT 
1 CONT "Märta Ulfsdotter. Owned land in Vallentuna hd in Uppland. She followed her second husband into exile in 1357, which is why her estate was confiscated and given to her son from her first marriage, Peter Ribbing. She was Queen Margareta's mistres
1 CONC s of the court in Norway. Married the first time no later than 1341 to the barrister of (southern) Halland Sigvid Ribbing, who lived 1336-1345, and the second time at the latest in 1355 with the knight Knut Algotsson (Bengt Hafridsson's family), wh
1 CONC o is mentioned 1354-1394."
1 CONT 
1 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Ulv%C3%A5sa%C3%A4tten#TAB_3
