1 CONT Grip — What It Actually Is
1 CONT Grip is BOTH:
1 CONT ⭐ 1. A true medieval Swedish noble surname
1 CONT AND
1 CONT ⭐ 2. The name of a noble ätt (clan/lineage)
1 CONT The coat of arms features a griffin (grip), which is where the name comes from.
1 CONT ⭐ Grip is a real hereditary noble surname used in the 1300s–1500s.
