0 @NFS2495@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT speculative. Mikolaj Wulkowski looks like von Guntersberg. Von Guntersberg were Herren auf Wulkow (see Simon von Güntersberg, Herr auf Wulkow). So Mikolaj as a Wojewoda looks to be from that family. There is a source also mentioning hims as Mikola
1 CONC j Wulkowski (von Wolkow, see source under his profile). His daughter carried h. Chomąto however. We have seen in some other cases where the Polish crest is taken over from the mother, if the father's crest wasn't originally polish (like von Gunter
1 CONC sberg). So if Dorota's herb is Chomąto, maybe it was from her mother ??
