1 CONC igurdsdatter on the other concerning 5 monthly meals in Ulvaldestad in Vang parish in Voss, which Sigrid had paid in fines for Valthjof's son Baard, whom her (former) husband Erik Ivar ssön had unintentionally killed, wherefore the land is awarde
