1 CONT Margaret 'Maid of Norway' Eriksdottir, Queen of Scotland was born before 9 April 1283 at Tönsberg, NorwayG.1 She was the daughter of Eirik II Magnusson, King of Norway and Margaret of Scotland, Princess of Scotland. She died circa 26 September 129
1 CONC 0 from drowning while en-route to Scotland, in the North Sea.1 She was buried at Bergen, NorwayG.1
1 CONT      She succeeded as the Queen Margaret of Scotland on 19 March 1286.1
1 CONT Citations
