1 CONT 
1 CONT Biography of Margaret (1286 to 1290)
1 CONT 'Maiden of Norway'
1 CONT Born April 1283 to Margaret of Scotland, daughter of King Alexander III of Scotland, and King Erik II Magnusson of Norway.
1 CONT Recognized as heir to the throne of Scotland in March 1284.
1 CONT Grandfather Alexander III died in 1286 and she became uncrowned Queen of Scotland.
1 CONT Died in 1290 in route to her coronation.
