1 CONT Henry III of England					Alexander II of Scotland						Margaret of Huntingdon		Isobel of Huntingdon
1 CONT Edward I of England				Margaret of England		Alexander III of Scotland		Yolanda of Dreux		Dervorguilla of Galloway		Robert Bruce
1 CONT Eric II of Norway		Margaret of Scotland		Alexander of Scotland		Margaret of Flanders		John Balliol	
1 CONT Edward II of England		Margaret, Maid of Norway									
1 CONT Notes
1 CONT  Eric II was survived by one child from his second marriage, a daughter named I
