0 @NFS2958@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT "Algot Bryniolfsson (son av Bryniolf Bengtsson, tab. 3). Uppträder i urkunderna 1322—1333. Ägde jord i Bråbo och Hammarkinds hd i Östergötland. Hans till namnet okända hustru, som dog före honom, hade tidigare varit gift med Harald Bryniol
1 CONC fsson (tre stengavlar), som uppträder 1304—1323, och hon var tydligen dotter till riddaren Tolf Petersson, vilken 1305 nämner Harald Bryniolfsson som sin »gener» tillsammans med sin son Johan; den sistnämnde, sedermera riksråd förde i vapn
1 CONC et tre balkvis ordnade blad.Tolf Peterssons enda kända hustru hette Margareta, men det är ej känt, om hon var hans dotters moder."
1 CONT 
1 CONT "Algot Bryniolfsson (son of Bryniolf Bengtsson, tab. 3). Appears in the records 1322-1333. Owned land in Bråbo and Hammarkinds hd in Östergötland. His name unknown wife, who died before him, had previously been married to Harald Bryniolfsson ( t
1 CONC hree stone gables), which appears in 1304-1323, and she was apparently the daughter of the knight Tolf Petersson, who in 1305 mentions Harald Bryniolfsson as his "gener" together with his son Johan; the latter, later councilor, carried in his coa
1 CONC t of arms three blades arranged in beams.Tolf Petersson's only known wife was named Margareta, but it is not known if she was the mother of his daughter."
1 CONT 
1 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Bengt_Hafridssons_%C3%A4tt#TAB_4
