1 CONT Research Notes
1 CONT 
1 CONT Edna Vacher's Genealogy of the Bankston (Benkestok) Family from 1947 has Andrew Bankston's original Swedish name as Andre Benkestok. His name would rather have been Anders Bengtsson; only one isolated mention of Benkestok exists.[1]
1 CONT 
1 CONT Andrew Bankston has thus become mistaken with Anders Jonsson Benkestok of Nordland, Norway. However, Andre Bankston was born about 1640, and was a teenager when he arrived in America in 1656.[1] Anders Benkestok died in 1634.
