1 CONT "Tord Bonde (son of Peter Bonde, Tab 1), to Örbäck. Knight. Still alive in 1328. Married before 1322 to Margareta Röriksdotter, daughter of knight Rörik Birgersson (beam) and Helga Anundsdotter (winged lily)."
1 CONT 
