0 @NFS3338@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT Who He WasAbjörn Nockesson is recognized by Swedish historians and the House of Nobility (Riddarhuset) as the progenitor (stamfar) of the noble family Bagge af Berga (Noble family No. 118).The Documentary Evidence: He is explicitly documented in t
1 CONC he Svenskt Diplomatarium (the Swedish National Archives' collection of medieval documents). For example, in a surviving parchment letter dated January 2, 1344 (SDHK-nr: 39803), Abjörn Nockesson and Bengt Lindormsson authorize a land transaction co
1 CONC ncerning property in Småland.  His Seal: Medieval documents were signed with wax seals. Abjörn's personal seal on the 1344 document—a six-pointed star—is still preserved and recorded by historians.Spouse: He was married to Ragnhild Lindormsdo
1 CONC tter.
