1 CONT 
1 CONT When Halvard was born, family names were rarely in use in Norway. Patronymics were still used as last name.
1 CONT Feel free to read this article about Norwegian names on Family Search WIKI: https://www.familysearch.org/en/wiki/Norway_Personal_Names
1 CONT 
