1 CONT http://thepeerage.com/p10288.htm#i102875:
1 CONT  Margaret of Scotland, Princess of Scotland was born on 28 February 1260/61 at Windsor Castle, Windsor, Berkshire, EnglandG.2 
1 CONT She was the daughter of Alexander III 'the Glorius', King of Scotland and Margaret of England, Princess of England. 
1 CONT She married Eirik II Magnusson, King of Norway, son of Magnus VI Haakonsson, King of Norway and Ingeborg Eriksdottir, Princess of Denmark, circa 31 August 1281 at Bergen, NorwayG.2 
1 CONT She died on 9 April 1283 at age 22 at Tönsberg, NorwayG, in childbirth.2 
1 CONT She was buried at Christ Kirk, Bergen, NorwayG.2
1 CONT Child of Margaret of Scotland, Princess of Scotland and Eirik II Magnusson, King of Norway
1 CONT Margaret 'Maid of Norway' Eriksdottir, Queen of Scotland b. b 9 Apr 1283, d. c 26 Sep 1290
1 CONT Citations
1 CONT [S106] Royal Genealogies Website (ROYAL92.GED), online http://www.daml.org/2001/01/gedcom/royal92.ged. Hereinafter cited as Royal Genealogies Website.
1 CONT [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Families: The Complete Genealogy (London, U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 200. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal Families.
