0 @NFS3756@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT "Ulf Magnusson. Uppträder enligt Utter tidigast 1316, enligt diplomen 1320. Blev riddare senast 1327. Dog något av åren 1338—1343. Var 1338 gift med Katarina, som då uppges vara syster till riksrådet och lagmannen Lars Ulfsson (Ama) och allt
1 CONC så torde ha varit dotter till dennes fader riksrådet Ulf Holmgersson (Ama), tydligen — att döma av hennes och mannens sena uppträdande i urkunderna — i dennes senare äktenskap med Birger jarls dotterdotter Elena. Är troligen identisk me
1 CONC d den Katarina Ulfsdotter, som 1346 kallas moder av en Ingeborg Torstensdotter, och torde sålunda före äktenskapet med Ulf Magnusson ha varit gift med en Torsten."
1 CONT 
1 CONT "Ulf Magnusson. Appears according to Utter in 1316 at the earliest, according to the diplomas in 1320. Was knighted at the latest in 1327. Died sometime between 1338 and 1343. Was married in 1338 to Katarina, who is then said to be the sister of th
1 CONC e Riksdag and lawman Lars Ulfsson (Ama) and therefore thought to have been the daughter of his father, Riksrådet Ulf Holmgersson (Ama), apparently — judging by her and her husband's late appearance in the records — in his later marriage to Bir
1 CONC ger earl's granddaughter Elena. Is probably identical to the Katarina Ulfsdotter, who in 1346 is called the mother of a Ingeborg Torsten's daughter, and thus probably before her marriage to Ulf Magnusson had been married to a Torsten."
1 CONT 
1 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Lejonbalk#TAB_2
