0 @NFS3777@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT "Hans till namnet okända hustru, som dog före honom, hade tidigare varit gift med Harald Bryniolfsson (tre stengavlar), som uppträder 1304—1323, och hon var tydligen dotter till riddaren Tolf Petersson, vilken 1305 nämner Harald Bryniolfsso
1 CONC n som sin »gener» tillsammans med sin son Johan; den sistnämnde, sedermera riksråd förde i vapnet tre balkvis ordnade blad.Tolf Peterssons enda kända hustru hette Margareta, men det är ej känt, om hon var hans dotters moder." 
1 CONT 
1 CONT "His name unknown wife, who died before him, had previously been married to Harald Bryniolfsson (three stone gables), who appears in 1304-1323, and she was apparently the daughter of the knight Tolf Petersson, who in 1305 mentions Harald Bryniolfss
1 CONC on as his "gener" together with his son Johan; the latter, later a member of parliament, carried in the coat of arms three blades arranged in beams. Tolf Petersson's only known wife was named Margareta, but it is not known if she was the mother o
1 CONC f his daughter."
1 CONT 
1 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Bengt_Hafridssons_%C3%A4tt#TAB_4
