1 CONC h the knight, national councilor, and lawyer of Tiohärad's court case, Ulf Abjörnsson (Sparre av Tofta) in his second marriage (first married to Christina Sigmundsdotter, daughter of Sigmund Keldorsson); dead before 1350-03-07.
