0 @NFS4295@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT Arnbjørn and his wife, Ingebjørg, are mentioned in 1331. On January 14, 1331 there was a meeting in Sandven to issue a Certificate of Inheiritance regarding the future heirs of Peter Joensson Sandven.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Summary: Peter at Augestad and Gudbrand at Steine ​​testify that the daughters of Peter from Sandven and his wife Ingebjørg, namely Margreta, Brigida and Herborg, with the consent of their husbands Elling, Arnbjørn and Nikulas - entered int
1 CONC o an agreement on inheritance: When one of the sisters died before the others, her children should have the inheritance after Peter that their mother should have had, and if all the daughters died before Peter, the children after each daughter shou
1 CONC ld have what their mother would have received.
