0 @NFS4327@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT "Herr Laurens var 12.6 1425omgift med Ida Johansdotter, dotter av riddaren Johan Bülow och hans fru Dorotea. Fru Ida levde änka ännu 29.9 1461, då hon skänkte sin sätesgård Aspenäs till Vadstena kloster, men var död 20.10 1462. Ägde jor
1 CONC d även i Karlstads och Näs hd i Värmland. Fru Ida dog utan ättlingar och ärvdes av sin broder Fickes barn." 
1 CONT 
1 CONT "Mr. Laurens was remarried on 12.6 1425 to Ida Johansdotter, daughter of the knight Johan Bülow and his wife Dorotea. Mrs. Ida was still a widow on 29.9 1461, when she donated her manor Aspenäs to Vadstena monastery, but died on 20.10 1462. Owne
1 CONC d land also in Karlstads and Näs hd in Värmland. Mrs. Ida died without descendants and was inherited by her brother Ficke's children."
1 CONT 
1 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Aspen%C3%A4s%C3%A4tten#TAB_10
