0 @NFS4394@ NOTE === Life Sketch ===
1 CONT "Sigvid Ribbing. Kallas av Detmar »en iungheling doles modes, van gheslechte des duren hertoghen Knut Porses». Tidigast nämnd 1335. Hövitsman i Södra Halland. Dog tidigast 1345. Gift med Märta Ulfsdotter, dotter till lagmannen Ulf Gudmarsso
1 CONC n (lejon) och den heliga Birgitta, omgift med riddaren Knut Algotsson (lejon, Bengt Algotssons ätt)."
1 CONT 
1 CONT "Sigvid Ribbing. Called by Detmar "en iungheling doles modes, van gheslechte des duren hertoghen Knut Porses". Earliest mentioned in 1335. Hövitsman in Södra Halland. Died at the earliest in 1345. Married to Märta Ulfsdotter, daughter of the law
1 CONC man Ulf Gudmarsson (lion) and the Saint Birgitta, remarried to the knight Knut Algotsson (lion, Bengt Algotsson's family)."
1 CONT 
