1 CONT Magnus Henriksson, King of Sweden married Birgitta Yngling, daughter of Harald IV Magnusson, King of Norway.2 He died in 1161.1
1 CONT      He succeeded as the King Magnus of Sweden in 1160.1
1 CONT Citations
1 CONT [S38] John Morby, Dynasties of the World: a chronological and genealogical handbook (Oxford, Oxfordshire, U.K.: Oxford University Press, 1989), page 151. Hereinafter cited as Dynasties of the World.
