1 CONT 
1 CONT Do NOT copy from.Ancestry to this site.
1 CONT Ancestry has the wife Anna Hård 1491-1569.  She is 4 years older than her mother-in-law, Katherine 1495-1516.   Katherine is younger than her son born 1490.  
1 CONT 
1 CONT Anna and Trond have 19 children on Ancestry.  Birth locations are all over Norway. Most do not make sense. (i,e., all over Oppland)
