1 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Aspen%C3%A4s%C3%A4tten#TAB_7
1 CONT 
1 CONT TABLE 6
1 CONT Bengt Jonsson (son of Jon Knutsson, tab. 5). Committee 20.11 1352-1374. Called sven still in 1371. Died 11.3 1382. Lived in Ärnäs in Kärnbo sn in Selebo hd in Södermanland. Was married on 25 May 1369 to Ingeborg Gregersdotter, daughter of the k
1 CONC night Gregers Styrbjörnsson ( Styrbjörnssönernas ätt ) and Katarina Bengtsdotter (head). In 1386, she is called wife Ingeborg in Ärnäs and was still alive on August 1, 1407, but was dead on March 8, 1413. In 1401, she exchanged some of her mo
1 CONC rning gifts, e.g. a. in Trögd's hd in Uppland and in Asker's hd in Närke, against goods, among others. a. in Tuhundra hd in Västmanland.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Children:
1 CONT 
1 CONT Gregers Bengtsson, 1386-1396, knight. See tab. 7.
1 CONT Knut Bengtsson, 1392, bur. 1420, district chief. See tab. 8.
1 CONT Helena (Elin) Bengtsdolter. Appears for the first time in a diploma, through which she and her husband exchanged her morning gift to Bo Jonsson (Grip), who died in 1386. Then only appears on 8.3 1413 as wife Helena av Lindö in Kärrbo sn in Siend
1 CONC e hd in Västmanland. Still alive 14.9 1421 but was dead 13.6 1432. Owned land in Ulleråkers hd in Uppland and Vifolka hd in Östergötland. Was, as indicated above, no later than 1386 married to the knight and district chief Ragvald Filipsson ( L
1 CONC indöätten ), who is otherwise mentioned in the sources 1370-1402.
1 CONT Laurens Bengtsson. Was dead 8.3 1413.
