0 @NFS5020@ NOTE === Biografi ===
1 CONT Katarina var av Bjälboätt, numera kallad Folkungaätten.
1 CONT Katarina utfärdade ett brev med Aspenäs som bosättningsdatum 12/3 1350, när hon lämnade sin gård Rönnäs, som ligger antingen i Asby-snön i Ydre härad i Östergötland eller i Agunnaryds snö i Sunnerbo härad i Småland.
0 @NFS5021@ NOTE ===  He was a high standing nobleman of Ryfy ===
1 CONT  He was a high standing nobleman of Ryfylke. He was a Knight andlater Baron. He gave son-in-law Finn Ogmundsson and daughterGudrun the Audasstader Estate of 30 mantabol, perhaps as abaptismal gift. Finn compensated his father-in-law with a ship.Fin
1 CONC n was from Finnøye, an island about 15 miles north ofStavanger. He is mentioned first in a document of 1296 from Stavanger whenalready a knight. In 1299 he and Jon Ivarsson, hisfather-in-law, witnessed a case involving Gudleik Kristinsson,his son-
1 CONC in-law. He was the youngest baron and advisor to King Haakon's decree ofinheritance and directions of September 16, 1302.  His seal ison a document that he "førte" a "bjelke" covered with 3 downwardturning shells of weapon.?? In 1321 he prepare
1 CONC d a document thatsaid his grandson Ogmund Finnsson should inherit the farmAudastad which Saebjorn got in trade from his son-in-law FinnOgmundsson for a ship. He was at Bergen in 1311-1322 as shown as witness in DNdocuments. In 1324 he gave Nådlan
1 CONC d farm in Ombo to the Stavenger cathedral.
0 @NFS5022@ NOTE === makeskiftede "Bjrke" p Follo mot Holter  ===
1 CONT makeskiftede "Bjrke" p Follo mot Holter i Nes, Akershus. Lagmann i Oslo 1279, lagmann i Bergen og Tnsberg. DN XII 30, 1302. DN II 19. Han hrer til i slektskretsen p Kyrningen i Oslo, og muligens stamfar til Hvam-Sta.
0 @NFS5023@ NOTE === Noble Role  ===
1 CONT Ture Kettilsson Bielke af Åkerö, born around 1260 (records vary to circa 1273) in Åkerö near Kalmar, Sweden, was a Swedish knight (riddare), riksråd (royal councilor), and kammarmästare (chamberlain) documented from 1283 ��. He married Si
1 CONC grid Nilsdotter (Sparre or Natt och Dag branch) and fathered Bengt Turesson Bielke af Åkerö (born circa 1291), linking to Kristina Bengtsdotter Bielke (born circa 1333) �.Family LineageAs son of Kettil (possibly Kettil Bengtsson or Petersson, m
1 CONC id-1200s), Ture held estates like Kråkerum in Småland and served during Folkunga consolidations, dying before March 29, 1327 �. His children included Nils, Erik, Nils Dannes, and Bengt, with the Bielke clan's red beam arms prominent in Västerg
1 CONC ötland-Småland networks.Noble RoleLagman in Värend and participant in stormannamöten (noble assemblies), Ture exemplified early frälsemän (knightly freeholders). Through Bengt and Kristina's marriage to Gerhard Snakenborg, his line connects t
1 CONC o Snakenborg-Bååt-Ulv-Vinstorpa-Rödbjälke-Grip-Djäkn-Lejonbalk and Kafle-Vinge ancestors like Ingeborg Johansdotter Kafle (1462) �.
