0 @NFS5068@ NOTE === New letter found ===
1 CONT I had a source for Gro Sigurdsdatter before someone deleted her from FamilySearch. The source was from a letter King Håkon V Magnusson wrote to Gro sayng "our daughter Agnes". There was a copy of the letter online and it was in old Norwegian. It w
1 CONC ould be hard for someone who was not a native Norwegian to understand what it said. Now I have to try and find the source again.....It is also important to know that many sources like the Norwegian leksikon and Wikipedia, and also other history boo
1 CONC ks are not updated. Many Norwegians have researched Gro Sigurdsdatter and there might be disagreement to where she was born, but they agree she was the mother of Agnes. There is info on Geni and MyHeritage etc. If people disagree they can add an un
1 CONC known spouse/mother for their own familytree. But please, do not delete.
