1 CONC s and Valkebo hd in Östergötland and Österrekarne hd in Södermanland and in Redvägs hd in Västergötland. Was married in 1278 to Cecilia Haraldsdotter, sister of the knight, councilor and lawman in Södermanland Anund Haraldsson ( Vingad lil
1 CONC y ) and thus daughter of his father Harald Gudmundsson. Received 13.2 1284 papal permission to enter into marriage with his sister-in-law Elena, who is then stated to be King Magnus' "consanguinea" and is therefore probably identical to his siste
1 CONC r Kristina Birgersdotter's 1282-1285 mentioned daughter with this name, who is also probably identical to that king Magnus' "frendkona" with this name, who had previously been married to the Danish knight Ingemar Nielsen, who was killed in 1278. Kr
1 CONC istina Birgersdotter is mentioned several times as married to the knight Sigge Guttormsson (two lilies with stems, rising from an open rose), but since Elena is not mentioned in his will, it is likely that she was Kristina's daughter from an unknow
1 CONC n previous marriage.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Children:
1 CONT 
1 CONT 1. Harald. Was 1293 kanik in Linköping. Owned land in Tjusts hd in Småland and died no later than 1305.
