0 @NFS5118@ NOTE === Noble context ===
1 CONT Kettil Bielke av Åkerö (also Kettil Bengtsson Bielke), born approximately 1235 in Sweden, was the father of Ture Kettilsson Bielke af Åkerö (born circa 1260). He belonged to the early Bielke noble family, holding estates in Åkerö and Smålan
1 CONC d during the 13th-century Folkunga era �.Family LineageSon of Bengt Jonsson Bielke (born circa 1220), Kettil married an unnamed woman (NN) and continued the clan's red beam heraldry among frälsemän (knightly freeholders). His descendants throug
1 CONC h Ture and Bengt Turesson produced Kristina Bengtsdotter Bielke (born circa 1333), who wed Gerhard Snakenborg �.Noble ContextActive amid Magnus Ladulås' reign, Kettil exemplified regional gentry alliances. Through Kristina, Anne Gerhardsdotter S
1 CONC nakenborg, Iliana Åkesdotter Bååt, and Staffan Ulfsson (Tillbakaseende Ulv), his line links to Vinstorpaätten, Grip, Djäkn, Lejonbalk, and Kafle-Vinge ancestors like Ingeborg Johansdotter Kafle (1462) �.
0 @NFS5119@ NOTE === Biografi ===
1 CONT Riddare, Storman och Folkunge från Östergötland
1 CONT Omnämnd för första gången 1272
1 CONT Var delaktig i Folkungaupproret, fängslades därför av Magnus Ladulås på Gälakvist borg i Skara, och avrättades efter räfst vid Stortorget i Stockholm
