0 @NFS5174@ NOTE === Brief Life History ===
1 CONT 
1 CONT He had two children.
1 CONT 1. His daughter *Cecilia Haraldsdotter (winged lily), died before 1284, was married before 1278 to Ulf Holmgersson (Ama) (lived 1290).[3]
1 CONT 2. His son and Cecilia's brother, King Magnus Ladulå's councillor, the knight * Anund Haraldsson was a lawman in Södermanland and died on the farm Fröshammar (now in Västmanland) in 1291. Married to Ingeborg Elofsdotter.
