0 @NFS5279@ NOTE ===  Arne lived in 1347 but had died before  ===
1 CONT  Arne lived in 1347 but had died before 1357. He gave 18 øyresbølin Nordset farm in South Odalen to the Oslo cathedral and owned5 øyresbøl in Lundberg in Nes. Arne's daughter married Tord,ancestor to Geirlaug Tordsson. In Bind IV on Lundberg fa
1 CONC rm it indicates: Lundberg farm wasowned by the Maria church in Oslo in the late Middle Ages butwas in private ownership before April 4, 1359 as Sira Helge ofNes and Solør parishes then indicated that Guttorm StrakJonsson, who was selling it had pu
1 CONC rchased it from GeirlaugTordsson, grandson of Arne Amundsen Kampe, and that Geirlaug hadinherited it from Arne Amundsen Kampe. That is all the information on our ancestor, Arne. His oldestbrother's descendants are the ones who are prominent inNorwe
1 CONC gian history.
