0 @NFS5292@ NOTE ===  She is not identified in Nes på Romerik ===
1 CONT  She is not identified in Nes på Romerike books, but herchildren's names fit well into her ancestors. Children: Saebjørn, married Margaret Pedersdatter of Foss in Blaker. Jorun, named at Østre Holter in 1347. Anund, gave 1 øyresbol in Nedre Hol
1 CONC ter to Nes church to save hissoul. Gudleik, operator of Frøyhov farm. Jarund, named in 1358, operator of Kolby farm in Ullensaker. Ivar, named in 1353 with Holte Gunnarsson. Holte, who may have been the oldest son. Sigrid, named in 1369 in connect
1 CONC ion with Kringler farm inNannestad.
