0 @NFS5312@ NOTE ===  He and his wife's uncle, Duke Skule, ha ===
1 CONT  He and his wife's uncle, Duke Skule, had a disagreement over theinheritance at Austratt and Rein and it was settled in 1238after a long dispute, but they became enemies. Upon orders from King Håkon, Asulf, one of Duke Skule'sbitterest enemies com
1 CONC manded a fleet and went to Nidaros inpursuit of Duke Skule who had fled there after losing a battlein Oslo. Duke Skule fled on to the Elgeseter Cloister indisguise. Asulf and the Birchlegs discovered his whereabouts anddemanded that he be given up
1 CONC . After being refused they set fireto the building and Duke Skule and his men came out and wereslain on May 24, 1240. That was a sacrilage and Åsulf went on apilgrimage. The family left Austratt and it was given to thechurch.,
