0 @NFS5334@ NOTE === Nils Sigridsson took his surname from his mother. ===
1 CONT Metronymic or mother's name is a name that has been formed from the bearer's mother's name and the suffix -son or -daughter. Metronymics are considerably rarer than patronymics, i.e. patronymics. In the Middle Ages, it was not uncommon for the moth
1 CONC er's name to be included in the son's. Nils Sigridsson took his surname from his mother.
