0 @NFS5355@ NOTE === There is no evidence for this person, nor for his parents ===
1 CONT The profile for Ivar Guttormsson “Nordheim” (b. abt 1280, d. abt 1317) has no attached sources for birth, death, residence, or relationships. The identity relies entirely on a constructed combination of a common given name (Ivar), a patronymi
1 CONC c (Guttormsson), and a farm label (Nordheim), none of which are supported by contemporary records. In this period, farm names were not hereditary surnames and cannot, by themselves, establish identity or lineage. Without primary documentation (e.g.
1 CONC , diplomas, land records, tax lists, or saga references explicitly naming this individual), there is no evidentiary basis to link this person to parents, spouse, or descendants. This profile therefore represents an unsourced placeholder, and all an
1 CONC cestral connections through him should be treated as unproven until documentary evidence is provided.
