0 @NFS5399@ NOTE === The Life Summary of Cicilia ===
1 CONT When Cicilia Haakonsdatter was born about 1221, in Folkenborg, Hobøl, Østfold, Norway, her father, King Haåkon Haåkonsson of Norway, was 17 and her mother, Kanga the Young of Folkinsberg, was 23. She married Lord Baron Gregorius Andresson Pot
1 CONC t af Stovreim. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 1 daughter. She died in October 1248, in Sumburgh, Mainland, Shetland, Scotland, United Kingdom, at the age of 27, and was buried in Norway.
