0 @NFS5489@ NOTE === Linage Role  ===
1 CONT Kristina Bengtsdotter Bielke, born around 1333 in Sweden, married Gerhard Snakenborg before 1386 and was the mother of Anne Gerhardsdotter Snakenborg (born circa 1327). She belonged to the prominent Bielke (Rödbjälke) noble family, known for thei
1 CONC r red beam coat of arms in Västergötland ��.Family ConnectionsDaughter of Bengt Turesson (Bielke) and a branch of 14th-century frälsemän, her union with the Mecklenburg migrant Gerhard bridged continental and Swedish gentry. This produced A
1 CONC nne, who wed Åke Ingvarsson Båt, linking to Iliana Åkesdotter Bååt (born 1354) ��.Lineage RoleThrough Anne and Iliana's marriage to Staffan Ulfsson (Tillbakaseende Ulv), Kristina connects to Vinstorpaätten (Bengt Uddsson), Grip, Djäkn, L
1 CONC ejonbalk, and the Kafle-Vinge chain ending at Ingeborg Johansdotter Kafle (1462) �. She died before 1386, per noble records.
