0 @NFS5500@ NOTE === Lendmann and Syslemann were titles - not names ===
1 CONT Lendmann was the highest rank attainable for those serving the Norwegian king.  A lendmann stood beneath only earls and kings.  A Syslemann was an ombudsman for the king...  I believe that the name was Arnbjorn Jonnson Ornes.
