0 @NFS5505@ NOTE === Who Is Holte Jonsson ===
1 CONT Holte Jonsson cannot be the son of Lendmann Jon Gautsen Ornes, who was never associated with Romerike (Akershus). Jon Gautsen had three well-documented sons: Arnbjørn, Askild/Åskell, and Gaut (and possibly a fourth son, Gunbjørn). All were fro
1 CONC m Western Norway.
1 CONT 
1 CONT His relationship to Jon Gautsen Ornes, then, was likely speculative in origin, but does not exist. This line within the tree, then, should be revised with further research
