0 @NFS5525@ NOTE === Source: ===
1 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Ulfsdotter-3
1 CONT 
1 CONT Ingeborg Ulfsdotter (Ulv), dotter till drotsen Ulf Karlsson (Ulv).
1 CONT 
1 CONT Första äktenskapet med riddaren Knut Matsson (Lejonbjälke), de skall ha fått åtminstone ett känt barn, en dotter vid namn Birgitta som var gift med Magnus Bengtsson (Bengt Bossons ätt). Dottern bör vara född allra senast år 1290 då Knu
1 CONC t Matsson dog 1289.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Det är möjligt att Ingeborg fick Göksholm som morgongåva av sin första man. Göksholm gick därefter i arv på kvinnolinjen i fyra generationer (Ingeborg Ulfsdotter (Ulv), Birgitta Knutsdotter (Lejonbjälke), Katarina Magnusdotter (Bengt Bosso
1 CONC ns ätt), Margareta Lidinvardsdotter (Lidinvard Haraldssons ätt) och Kristina Magnusdotter (Magnus Marinasons ätt)).
1 CONT 
1 CONT Ingeborg var omgift senast 1296 med riddaren, riksrådet, sedermera drotsen Abjörn Sixtensson (Sparre av Tofta).
1 CONT 
1 CONT Maken Abjörn Sixtensson blev far till Nils Abjörnsson (Sparre av Tofta) och Ulf Abjörnsson (Sparre av Tofta). Förmodligen kan Ingeborg vara modern.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Dog mellan 1297 och 1307.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Biography
1 CONT European Aristocracy
1 CONT Ingeborg Ulfsdotter was a member of the aristocracy in Europe.
1 CONT Ingeborg was the daughter of the knight Ulf Karlsson Ulv. She was first married to the knight Knut Matsson (Lejonbjälke) who died in 1289. They had at least one known child, a daughter named Birgitta who married Magnus Bengtsson (Bengt Bossons ät
1 CONC t).
1 CONT 
1 CONT Ingeborg remarried, no later than 1296, the knight and member of the Privy Council of Sweden Abjörn Sixtensson (Sparre av Tofta). He had the sons Nils and Ulf, Ingeborg was possibly their mother. Ingeborg died sometime between 1297 and 1307.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Research Notes
1 CONT Questionable Children
1 CONT There are several children attached to this profile who have no sources for the connection. There is a Abjörn Ulfsson Sparre who, together with Kristina Nannadotter, had the children Erik, Unknown, Nanne, Knut, Nils and Kristina. There has probabl
1 CONC y been a mix up between the two Abjörn Sparre.[1] See discussion on Anbytarforum about Nanne Abjörnsson and his sister, the children of Abjörn Ulfsson Sparre and Kristina Nannadotter. And Kyrkohistorisk Årsskrift that says that the brother of N
1 CONC anne Abjörnsson, Nils Abjörnsson, often has been mistaken for the Nils Abjörnsson who was the son of Abjörn Sixtensson.
1 CONT 
1 CONT 
1 CONT 
1 CONT 
1 CONT 
1 CONT Sources
1 CONT ↑ Theory by Lena Svensson
1 CONT Tillbakaseende Ulv, Adelsvapen-Wiki
1 CONT Abjörn Sixtensson, Sparre av Tofta, Adelsvapen-Wiki
