0 @NFS5557@ NOTE === SOURCE: ===
1 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Tillbakaseende_ulv#TAB_03
1 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Ulfsson-70
1 CONT 
1 CONT 
1 CONT 
1 CONT TABLE 3
1 CONT Philippus Ulfsson (son of Ulf Karlsson, tab. 2). Earliest mentioned in 1296. Became a knight sometime between 1296-1303 - thus dubbed either at King Birger's wedding in 1298 or at his coronation in 1302 - and at the latest in 1305 a councilor, whic
1 CONC h he was still in 1322 and probably still in 1333. Said to have lived in "Langanaes", which is identified with Långnäs in Kettilstads sn, Kinda hd i Östergötland. Married first to a dotier or at least a close relative of the knight and councilo
1 CONC r Karl Gustavsson two crossed stave lilies and then to Gödelin Gotskalksdotter , who owned land in Bobergs hd in Östergötland and was still alive in 1341 and was the daughter of the knight Gotskalk van Kyren .
1 CONT 
1 CONT Children of the 1st marriage:
1 CONT 
1 CONT 1. Ulf Philippusson, 1319-1350, knight. See tab. 4.
1 CONT 1. Karl Philippusson, 1320-1333, gunsmith. See tab. 9.
1 CONT 1. Johan Philippusson. Occurs at the earliest in 1335. Was knighted between 13.4 and 13.12 1336, so probably at King Magnus' coronation in July s.å.. Owned maternally inherited land in Vifolka hd in Östergötland. Died between 1336 and 1340. Hi
1 CONC s widow was 1340 Bengta Nilsdotter, possibly the daughter of the knight Nils Kettilsson ( Bielke ) and Bengta Algotsdotter ( Algot Jonsson's family ).
1 CONT 1. Ingrid Philippusdotter. Probably married first to the councilor Ragvald Magnusson ( Lejonbalk ), who is mentioned in 1319-1322, and at the latest in 1344 to the knight Karl Bengtsson ( oxhuvud ), who owned land in i.a. Kumla hd in Närke, Finsp
1 CONC ångaläns hd in Östergötland and Oppunda hd in Södermanland and died in 1350.
1 CONT Children of the 2nd marriage:
1 CONT 
1 CONT 2. (?) Märta Philippusdotter. Received 9.5 1345 land in Faurås and Himle hd in Halland as a gift from Sigvid Trana , who was knighted between 1349 and 1352 and died at the earliest in 1352. Was married in 1362 to Mats Håkansson ( Bergkvaraätte
1 CONC n ), who is mentioned at the earliest in 1353, lived in Ulvsberg in Gammalkils sn , Valkebo hd in Östergötland and was still alive in 1393.
1 CONT 2. Eggard Philippusson. Only known through a tombstone, which was in Gärdserum's church in Norra Tjusts hd in Småland.
1 CONT 2. Margareta Philippusdotter. Only known through gravestone in Gärdserum's church.
1 CONT 2. Magnus Philippusson. Said to have lived in 1341.
1 CONT 2. Bengt Philippusson, 1341-1381, knight, councillor, justice. See tab. 11.
1 CONT 2. Erik Philippusson. First mentioned in 1341.
1 CONT 2. A daughter. Married to Karl Haraldsson ( Stubbe ) at Ålhult in Södra Vi sn, Sevede hd in Småland, identified with the 1330-1331 mentioned bailiff at Turku castle, remarried Cecilia Algotsdotter and died between 1331 and 1370.
0 @NFS5558@ NOTE === Linage Impact ===
1 CONT Filip Ulfsson (Ulv), born approximately 1265 (records vary from before 1280 to circa 1270–1276), was a Swedish knight (riddare) and riksråd (royal councilor) from 1305 until at least 1333, active in Östergötland and Horsnäs estates ��. So
1 CONC n of Ulf Karlsson (Ulv), he married NN Karlsdotter and fathered Ulf Filipsson (Ulv) (born circa 1300), linking directly to Staffan Ulfsson and Kristina Staffansdotter Ulv's marriage into Vinstorpaätten �.Noble CareerKnighted around 1296–1303 (
1 CONC possibly at King Birger's 1302 coronation), Filip served during Folkunga power struggles, holding lands across Östergötland, Småland, and Södermanland as part of the Tillbakaseende Ulv (rear-facing wolf) clan �. Died after 1333, likely in Lå
1 CONC ngnäs.Lineage ImpactHis descendants intermarried with Staffanssönernas ätt, elevating the Ulv line's influence pre-Kalmar Union and connecting through Kristina (born circa 1375) to Bengt Uddsson Vinstorpaätten, onward to Kafle-Vinge ancestors l
1 CONC ike Ingeborg Johansdotter Kafle (1462) �.
