0 @NFS5701@ NOTE === Tord and Kirstine ===
1 CONT  On October 13, 1572, a formal letter sealed by Tord Benkestokk was presented before the Cathedral Chapter (Domkapitlet) in Stavanger, Norway. The document detailed a paternity case addressing the child, Maren, born from Kirstine's affair with Tord
1 CONC . 
1 CONT 
1 CONT Kirstine was married to a man named Hans Povelson. Because she was married at the time of the affair, her relationship with Tord Benkestokk was legally and socially classified as infidelity (adultery). Source: https://www.benkestokkslekten.no/om-be
1 CONC nkestokslekten/
