1 CONT Tab 11 
1 CONT Bo Bosson son of Bo Nielisson, den Aldre Tab 9 till Gokaholm samt Saby i Wists socken i Ostergothland; Var 1336-1370 Riddare och Svea Rikes Rad; Lefde annu 1386.  Han bevittnade sin systersons, Riks Drottsen Bo Jonsson Grips testamente deruti hono
1 CONC m tillagges 1000 mark lodig.  Gift med Carin Fargait, som gaf sig efter mannen dod i Skenninge kloster, hvilket fick for hennes ingift Tokatorp, Thorks Wakarahola och Hogmala i Frenniage socken: dottr af Peder Ragvaldsson, gen Gamle, till Hedenso
1 CONC , med Britta Joensdotter Bla.
1 CONT 
1 CONT ENGLISH: 
1 CONT Bo Bosson son of Bo Nielisson, the Elder Tab 9 to Gokaholm and Saby in the parish of Wist in Ostergothland; Was 1336-1370 Knight and Svea Rikes Rad; Lefde annu 1386. He witnessed the will of his niece, Riks Drottsen Bo Jonsson Grip, in which 1,00
1 CONC 0 marks were added to him. Married to Carin Fargait, who died after her husband's death in Skenninge Kloster, which received for her marriage Tokatorp, Thorks Wakarahola and Hogmala in Frenniage parish: daughter of Peder Ragvaldsson, gen Gamle, t
1 CONC o Hedenso, with Britta Joensdotter Bla.
1 CONT    was not able to use diacritical marks so goggle translation needs help, but it does give some support for her being married to Bo Bosson
