0 @NFS5828@ NOTE === Birth place of Sigrid Gregoriusdatter ===
1 CONT Records of Sigrid Gregoriusdatter by Torleif S. Knaphus show that she was born in Ryfylke, Stavanger, Norway, in about 1246.  It also shows that her husband, Gaute Erlingsen was born in Ryfylke, Stavanger, Norway, in about 1242.
0 @NFS5829@ NOTE === The Life Summary of Sigrid Gregoriusdatter ===
1 CONT When Lady Sigrid Gregoriusdatter Af Stavreim was born about 1246, in Stårheim, Eid, Sogn og Fjordane, Norway, her father, Lord Baron Gregorius Andresson Pott af Stovreim, was 36 and her mother, Cicilia Haakonsdatter, was 25. She married Baron Gaut
1 CONC e Talgje ERLINGSSEN about 1260, in Talgje, Finnøy, Rogaland, Norway. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 2 daughters. She died in 1288, in Talgje, Finnøy, Rogaland, Norway, at the age of 42, and was buried in Norway.
