0 @NFS5931@ NOTE === The Life Summary of Gregorius ===
1 CONT Lord Baron Gregorius Andresson Pott af Stovreim was born in 1210, in Stårheim, Eid, Sogn og Fjordane, Norway. He married Cicilia Haakonsdatter. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 1 daughter. He died on 3 January 1246, in Eid kyrkje, Eid
1 CONC , Sogn og Fjordane, Norway, at the age of 36, and was buried in Bergen, Hordaland, Norway.
