0 @NFS6035@ NOTE === Lineage impact ===
1 CONT Gerhard Snakenborg, born before 1352 in Mecklenburg, Germany, was a nobleman from the Schnakenburg (Snakenborg) family who migrated to Sweden. He married Kristina Bengtsdotter Bielke before 1386 and fathered Anne Gerhardsdotter Snakenborg (born cir
1 CONC ca 1327, Aspö), linking continental German gentry to Swedish frälsemän networks �.Family MigrationSon of Alveric (or Hermann) Snakenborg from Lichtenhagen, Gerhard settled in Södermanland, with his daughter's marriage to Åke Ingvarsson Bå
1 CONC t (born circa 1325) bridging Mecklenburg knights to Skåne Bååt estates during 14th-century Danish-Swedish ties �.Lineage ImpactThrough Anne and Iliana Åkesdotter Bååt (born 1354), his descendants wed Staffan Ulfsson (Tillbakaseende Ulv), co
1 CONC nnecting to Vinstorpaätten (Bengt Uddsson), Rödbjälke, Grip, Djäkn, Lejonbalk, and the Kafle-Vinge chain from Ingeborg Johansdotter Kafle (1462) �. He died around 1402, per genealogical records.
0 @NFS6036@ NOTE === Linage ===
1 CONT Alveric Snakenborg (also Hermann Snakenborg of Lichtenhagen), born approximately 1315 in Mecklenburg, Germany, was the father of Gerhard Snakenborg (born before 1352). He originated from the Schnakenburg knightly family near Lichtenhagen, with hi
1 CONC s lineage migrating to Sweden in the 14th century.�Family MigrationAs a Mecklenburg noble, Alveric's descendants settled in Södermanland via Gerhard's marriage to Kristina Bengtsdotter Bielke, positioning Anne Gerhardsdotter Snakenborg (born cir
1 CONC ca 1327) to marry Åke Ingvarsson Båt and bridge continental gentry to Skåne-Swedish alliances.�Lineage ContinuationThrough Anne, Iliana Åkesdotter Bååt (1354), Staffan Ulfsson (Tillbakaseende Ulv), and Kristina Staffansdotter Ulv, Alveric c
1 CONC onnects to Vinstorpaätten (Bengt Uddsson), Rödbjälke, Grip, Djäkn, Lejonbalk, and the Kafle-Vinge chain ending at Ingeborg Johansdotter Kafle (1462).�
