0 @NFS6046@ NOTE === Äldre svenska frälseätter ===
1 CONT Sweden's Riddarhuset (house of nobles) publishes a series of books on different forms of noble families. ÖRNSPARRE is in the Äldre svenska frälseätter (which are usually the family of knights that have a letter from the King saying they are ÄS
1 CONC F, for example, ÄSF families free of paying taxes in return for pledging to support the king with their "horse and armour." Äldre svenska frälseätter says, "Född 1298 i Hässleby (F). Död 1317. Hon levde ännu änka 1312 och ägde jord i Vart
1 CONC ofta hd i Västergötland. Hon var möjligen identisk med fru Margareta Filipsdotter, som 1317 hade patronatsrätt i Vadsbro församling i Oppunda hd i Södermanland, och sannolikt dotter av Södermanlandslagmannen Filip Ingevaldsson (Örnsparre)
1 CONC " which can be translated to Born in 1298 in Hässleby (F). Died in 1317. She was still alive as a widow in 1312 and owned land in Vartofta hundred in Västergötland. She was possibly the same person as Lady Margareta Filipsdotter, who in 1317 hel
1 CONC d the patronage rights in Vadsbro parish in Oppunda hundred in Södermanland, and was likely the daughter of Filip Ingevaldsson (Örnsparre), the lawman of Södermanland (ÄSF delI1, s.100a). Therefore I have changed the date from 1255 to 1298.
