1 CONT TABLE 11
1 CONT Bengt Philippusson (son of Philippus Ulfsson, tab. 3). First mentioned in 1341. Knighted sometime between 1346-1349. Mentioned among King Erik's council in 1356 and 1358 and as a councilor from 1361 and again in 1379. Was King Albrekt's justiciariu
1 CONC s in 1365. Mentioned as district chief in Kinda hd in Östergötland in 1356 and again 23.6 1380. Was district chief in Oppunda hd in Södermanland from between 1361 and 1365 to between 8.6 and 23.11 1381 and is mentioned on 10.10 1381 as distric
1 CONC t chief in Valkebo hd in Östergötland. Dated letter in Långnäs in Kettilstads sn, Kinda hd in Östergötland, where the father lived. Died between 8.12 1381 and 11.3 1382. Married at the latest in 1349 to Birgitta Karlsdotter, who was still ali
1 CONC ve in 1359 and was the daughter of the knight and councilor Karl Näskonungsson (split shield), probably in his only known marriage to Helga Petersdotter (3 diagonal squares), because her mother Her name was Birgitta. Was remarried in 1369 to a dau
1 CONC ghter of the knight and councilor Magnus Gisleson ( Sparre av Aspnäs ) and Birgitta Knutsdotter ( Algotssönernas ätt ). In 1375 Bengt was remarried again, now to Cecilia Ulfsdotter, who owned land in Jönåkers, Oppunda and Österrekarne hd in S
1 CONC ödermanland, Siende and Snevringe hd in Västmanland, Torstuna hd in Uppland and Kåkinds and Vartofta hd in Västergötland, died 12.3 1399, buried in Vadstena , previously married to the district chief in Österrekarne hd Laurens Suneson ( Örns
1 CONC parre ) and was the daughter of the knight, councilor and lawman in Närke Ulf Gudmarsson ( Ulvåsaätten ) and Birgitta Birgersdotter ( Finstaätten ).
1 CONT 
1 CONT Sons:
1 CONT 
1 CONT 2. Magnus Bengtsson. Seals as early as 1373 and is mentioned from 1374. Died sometime between 1391 - 1401. Married at the latest in 1380 to Cecilia Sigmundsdotter, who died between 1419 and 1430 after remarrying at the latest in 1415 to the knigh
1 CONC t Magnus Birgersson ( Birger Tureson's family ) and was the daughter of Sigmund Elefsson ( winged arrow ) and Bengta Jonsdotter ( The aspen ridges ).
1 CONT 2. Gotskalk Bengtsson, 1380-1453, knight, councillor. See tab. 12.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Occupation: Riddare, Riksråd og Justtiarius
1 CONT 
1 CONT Note: nevnt som häradshövdin i Uppunda hd. 1361 - 1365 Note: Har daterat brev i Långnäs i Kettilstad sn. Kinda hd. i Östergötland (der fadern bott) Note: Bengt Phillippusson's tredje kone Cecilia Ulfsdotter, dotter till Ulf Gudmarsson (Ulvås
1 CONC aätten) som ennu umyndig giftet seg med den 13 årige Birgitta Birgersdotter (Finstaätten),, senere kalt den helliga Birgitta).
1 CONT 
1 CONT 
1 CONT Bengt was born about 1320. He was the son of Filip Ulfsson and Gödelin Gotskalksdotter. He passed away about 1382.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Bengt Phillippusson (Ulv) var tidligst nevnt 1341 - till 1381. Han er nevnt som riddare 1346 - 1349 - Risråd 1366 och ennu i 1379. Han nevnes blant Kung Eriks råd 1356 och 1358, og var Konung Albrekts Justitiarius i 1365. Nevnt som häradshövdin
1 CONC g i Kinda herad i Östergötland 1356 och ennu 23.Juni.1380. Var häradshövding i Uppunda herad i Södermansland från mellon 1361 och 1365 till mellom 8.Juni och 23.Nov.-1381, och nämnes 10.Okt.1381 som häradshövding i Valkebo herad i Österg
1 CONC ötland. Bengt har daterat brv i Långnäs i Kettilstad socken, Kinda herad i Östergötland (der fadern bott). Bengt Phillippusson (døde mellan 8.des.1381 och 11.Mars- 1382) Han var gift første gang senast 1349 med Birgitta Karlsdotter, levde en
1 CONC nu i 1359, dotter av Riddaren och Riksråden Karl Näskonungsson (delad Sköld) och hans fru Helga Petersdotter (3 snedrutor), dennes mor het også Birgitta.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Som enkeman ble han innen 1369, gift igjen med ei med ukjent fornavn, Magnusdotter, død för 1375, Dotter av Riddaren och Riksråden Magnus Gislasson (Sparre av Aspnäs) och dennes fru, Birgitta Knutsdotter (Algotsonernas ätt).
1 CONT 
1 CONT I 1375 er han gift igjen, denne gang med Cecilia Ulfsdotter (Ulvåsaätten), som eide jord i Jönåkers , i Oppunda och Österrekarne hd. i Södermanland, Siende och Snevringe hd. i Västmanland, Torstuna hd i Uppland, samt Kåkinds och Vartofta h
1 CONC d Västergötland. Hun var dotter av Riddaren och Riksråden Ulf Gudmarsson (Ulvåsaätten) (av Svenska Frälset), och Birgitta Birgersdotter (Finstaätten). (senere kalt Helliga Birgitta Cecilia dog 12.Mars 1399, begravet i Vadstena . Cecilia Ulfs
1 CONC dotter hadde tidligere vært gift med häradshövdingen i Österrekkarne hd Laurens Sunesson (Örnsparre)
1 CONT 
