1 CONT It is believed that she was the illegitimate daughter of Torunn and Sigurd Håkonson, although Torunn was married to Tore Greipson. She was raised by Tore Greipson. [Sherpe, Howard M. A Royal Connection? The Family Line through Torunn Back to the V
1 CONC ikings and Norse Kings. (sherpe.com/family/pdfs/sherpe_ostrem_history/torunn.pdf: 1996).]
