0 @NFS6102@ NOTE === Issues with link from Norway to Bornholm ===
1 CONT Benketok is an old Norwegian noble family - I see no connection to Bornholm (they were not traders unlike the Hansa merchants (from Lubeck or Rostock) who settled on the island of Bornholm in the 16th century). And why is "the son" Peder Andersso
1 CONC n Juul listed as born on Bornholm but dead in Sweden - and his surname doesn't match with "his siblings". The Juul family have been farmers around Åkirkeby, Åker, Bornholm for generations.
