0 @NFS6122@ NOTE === Linage ===
1 CONT Katarina Karlsdotter Lejonbalk (often listed as "Karlsdotter" in abbreviated records), born approximately 1265 in Sweden, married Ulf Karlsson (Ulv) around that time and was the mother of Filip Ulfsson (Ulv) (born circa 1265).��Family RoleDaugh
1 CONC ter of Karl Ingeborgsson Lejonbalk from the Lejonbalk noble family, she connected the Ulv (Folkunga branch) to lion-beam heraldry estates in Östergötland. Some trees name her explicitly as Katarina or NN Karlsdotter, with siblings like Ingeborg K
1 CONC arlsdotter Lejonbalk (born circa 1245).��Lineage ContextHer union produced the Tillbakaseende Ulv descendants leading to Kristina Staffansdotter Ulv (born circa 1375), who wed Bengt Uddsson Vinstorpaätten—tying into the full chain from Vinst
1 CONC orpa, Rödbjälke, Grip, and Djäkn to Kafle-Vinge ancestors like Ingeborg Johansdotter Kafle (1462).� 13th-century records remain fragmentary, blending charters with noble reconstructions.
