0 @NFS6174@ NOTE Claus was a bailiff and manager at a fine goods store at Voss. Both he and Ingrid resided at Mossefinn at Voss and had six children.
0 @NFS6175@ NOTE === Moved to Mosafinn on October 10, 1700
1 CONT 
1 CONT K ===
1 CONT Moved to Mosafinn on October 10, 1700
1 CONT 
1 CONT Klaus lived at Mosafinn, of which he was the owner since about 1655, and he was a powerful man.  He inherited a great deal of real estate from his father; he was the bailiff and in addition was 'protector' of the Crown properties at Voss.  Two of t
1 CONC heir daughters married farm boys from Voss and after them we have a wide-spread linage in the district.  It was called the 'bailiff lineage'.
