0 @NFS6227@ NOTE === Who Is NN Arnbjørnsdatter? ===
1 CONT Some trees suggest that Jon Gautsen's wife was NN Arnbjørnsdatter Ambe, but do so with out any source documentation (beyond another 'tree'). This relationship, then, seems to be either highly speculative or fictive, and should be, until documente
1 CONC d via a primary source, treated with skepticism.
