1 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Bonde_nr_11#TAB
1 CONT 
1 CONT TABLE 6
1 CONT Knut Bonde (son of Tord Bonde, Tab. 5 ), died 1413. Knight. Hövidsman at Turku Castle. Married 1408-09-20 to Margareta Karlsdotter , daughter of the Riksdag and marshal Karl Ulfsson ( Sparre av Tofta ) and Helena Israelsdotter ( Finstaätten ).
1 CONT 
1 CONT Children :
1 CONT 
1 CONT Karl Knutsson, born 1408, died 1470 King. See Tab. 7 .
1 CONT 
1 CONT Margareta was the daughter of Karl Ulfsson Sparre, a knight with several other titles, in his third of fourth marriage.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Married the knight Knut Tordsson Bonde. Together they had the son Karl Knutsson Bonde who became king of both Sweden and Norway. Knut died in 1413.
1 CONT 
1 CONT In 1414 she married Sten Turesson Bielke with whom she had the daughter Birgitta Stensdotter Bielke.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Margareta was buried in the Vadstena Monastery March 15, 1429.[1]
1 CONT 
1 CONT Estates
1 CONT Fogelvik, Tryserum
1 CONT Sources
1 CONT ↑ Bennett, Robert; Gustafsson, Evald (1985) Vadstena klosterkyrka. 3, Gravminnen p.46
1 CONT Saprre av Tofta, Adelsvapen-Wiki
