1 CONT 
1 CONT Botild was the daughter of Claus Abildgaard (or Apellgard)[1] and his wife Estrid (most likely Estrid Arvidsdotter (Pik))[2]
1 CONT Abild, her father's estate in Halland County,[(Halland County is located in Götaland and it was geographically identical with Halland province. 6] which might be where she grew up.
1 CONT 
1 CONT Lasse, according to ÄSF 1:3 p 242, Sven Bäk's (Krumme) wife Botild was the daughter of Claus Apellegard and his wife Estrid, the latter probably identical to Estrid Arvidsdotter (Pik). In this context, ÄSF refers to Stig Östenson: Marginal note
1 CONC s to bishop Hans Brask's family book in PHT 1973 p 113 f.
1 CONT  
