0 @NFS6282@ NOTE === Which of the three wives of Bengt Philippusson is the mother of Gotskalk Bengtsson ===
1 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Tillbakaseende_ulv
1 CONT 
1 CONT 
1 CONT 
1 CONT It is shown that Bengt Philippusson was married to three different women.  Adelvapen suggests that the three children are from second wife who was unknown Magnusdotter.  however, it is possible that Gotskalk was the child of one of the other women
1 CONC .  
1 CONT WIKI shows only wife #3. but, since son Gotskalk is supposedly married by 1390 it is not likely that his mother was #3,  much more like 1 or 2  
1 CONT 
1 CONT Here are the three women who should all be included as Bengt's wives:  
1 CONT 
1 CONT 1. Married at the latest in 1349 to Birgitta Karlsdotter, who was still alive in 1359 and was the daughter of the knight and councilor Karl Näskonungsson (split shield), probably in his only known marriage to Helga Petersdotter (3 diagonal squares
1 CONC ), because her mother Her name was Birgitta. 
1 CONT 
1 CONT 2. Was remarried in 1369 to a daughter of the knight and councilor Magnus Gisleson ( Sparre av Aspnäs ) and Birgitta Knutsdotter ( Algotssönernas ätt ). 
1 CONT (This is what it says on father's site; 
1 CONT Daughter. Probably still alive in 1373 but was dead in 1375, when her husband mentioned below was remarried. Married at the latest in 1369 to the knight and councilor Bengt Filipsson ( Wolf ), who had previously been married to Birgitta Karlsdotte
1 CONC r (split shield; daughter of Karl Näskonungsson), who was still alive in 1359, and at the earliest in 1375 remarried Cecilia Ulfsdotter ( Ulvåsaätten ) and died around 1382. Their descendants inherited Magnus Gislason's seat farm Aspnäs.
1 CONT 
1 CONT 3. In 1375 Bengt was remarried again, now to Cecilia Ulfsdotter, who owned land in Jönåkers, Oppunda and Österrekarne hd in Södermanland, Siende and Snevringe hd in Västmanland, Torstuna hd in Uppland and Kåkinds and Vartofta hd in Västergö
1 CONC tland, died 12.3 1399, buried in Vadstena , previously married to the district chief in Österrekarne hd Laurens Suneson ( Örnsparre ) and was the daughter of the knight, councilor and lawman in Närke Ulf Gudmarsson ( Ulvåsaätten ) and Birgitt
1 CONC a Birgersdotter ( Finstaätten ).
