0 @NFS6288@ NOTE ===  Tord Geirlaugsson was married to NN (na ===
1 CONT  Tord Geirlaugsson was married to NN (name not known) ArnesdatterKamp from Holter in Nes. He had at least one child namedGeirlaug. In 1359 Guttorm Strak Jonsson sold 5 øyresbol inLunberg in Nes to Gudbrand Andresson of Stor-Hvam (the big farmat Hv
1 CONC am) and there was information that Guttorm had bought partof the land of Geirlaug Tordsson, grandson of Arne Kamp.Geirlaug had inherited this from Arne Kamp.
