0 @NFS6309@ NOTE === Her Ancestors are out of order and looping ===
1 CONT The pedigree is out of order.  It shows her father as Karl Kristiernsson Vas -1440, LCXH-VQF, her grandfather as Kristiern Nilson Vasta 1365-1442 LZRK-55X, great grandfather, Nils Kettilsson 1335-1379, LZy4-QJB,  and great-great grandfather as Kett
1 CONC il Karlson Vasa 1434-1465, GQFQ-7R6.  Reordering as follows:  GQFQ-7RG as her father, LCXH-VQF, as her grandfather, LZRK-55X as her great grandfather, and LZY4-QJB as her great-great grandfather.
0 @NFS6310@ NOTE === verifies parents ===
1 CONT Bo Nilsson married around 1454 Beata Karlsdotter (Vasa), daughter of the Riksdag Karl Kristiernsson (Vasa) and Ebba Eriksdotter ( Krummedige ). Together they had the son Nils Bosson (Grip) (1460-1522).
0 @NFS6311@ NOTE === notice ===
1 CONT Nilsson is mascular  patronymic name of husband (lit. Nils's son) and has nothing to do with spouse. Wives also always kept their maiden name, only as widow they might be referred to as husbands name but not likely for noble families, especially th
1 CONC is high in the ranks.  
1 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/en/rootstech/session/navigating-scandinavian-patronymics
0 @NFS6312@ NOTE === Sources: ===
1 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Magnusson-172
1 CONT https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ivar_Nilssons_%C3%A4tt
