1 CONT Nils Magnusson is mentioned in 1356 as king Erik's council. The name Ivar entered the family only in the third known generation, when Nils' grandson Nils Magnusson married Kristina Ivarsdotter Rova, a daughter of the shepherd in Tønsberg named Iva
1 CONC r Nilsson .
1 CONT 
1 CONT Ivar Nilsson ( Ivar Nilsson's family ) was born in the 14th century . He was the son of the Riksdag Nils Magnusson (Ivar Nilsson's family) and Kristina Ivarsdotter Rova, a daughter of the shepherd in Tønsberg named Ivar Nilsson .
1 CONT Sources: 
