1 CONT re:  husband 
1 CONT Married 1st 1429-02-28 at Ekholmen to Birgitta Turesdotter (Bielke) , daughter of the knight and councilor Ture Stensson ( Bielke ) and Birgitta Abrahamsdotter (bull's head).
1 CONT 
1 CONT called Birgitta Turesdotter  Married 28 Feb 1429 in Ekholmen, Sweden  
1 CONT 
1 CONT På svenska
1 CONT Birgitta Turesdotter var dotter till Ture Stensson (Bielke) och Birgitta Abrahamsdotter (Tjurhuvud).
1 CONT 
1 CONT Hon gifter sig med Karl Knutsson (Bonde) troligen ca 1428 på Ekholmens slott, Veckholms socken. Barn:
1 CONT [1]
1 CONT 
1 CONT Ture, dog ung, före 23 juni 1447
1 CONT Kristina Gift 1446 på Svartsjö med Erik Eriksson och får Fågelvik strax efter sitt giftemål. Född omkr. 1432, död före 25 januari 1500.
1 CONT Birgitta dör ca 1436.
1 CONT 
1 CONT In English
1 CONT Birgitta Turesdotter Bielke was the daughter of Ture Stensson.[2]
1 CONT 
1 CONT Believed to have married in 1428, but surely before March 1, 1429, to King Karl VIII Knutsson (Bonde), in his first marriage.[2]
1 CONT 
1 CONT Birgitta died 1436 in Stockholm, and was buried in Vadstena. [3]
1 CONT 
1 CONT Sources
1 CONT ↑ Adelsvapen, Bonde nr 11
1 CONT ↑ 2.0 2.1 House of Bielke.
1 CONT ↑ Bennett, Robert; Gustafsson, Evald (1985) Vadstena klosterkyrka. 3, Gravminnen p. 69-70
