0 @NFS6388@ NOTE === Birth place of Gaute Erlingsen ===
1 CONT Records of Gaute Erlingsen by Torleif S. Knaphus show that he was born in Ryfylke, Stavanger, Norway, in about 1242.  It also shows that his wife, Sigrid Gregoriusen was born in Ryfylke, Stavanger, Norway (in about 1246).
