0 @NFS6447@ NOTE === **Incorrect Merges** ===
1 CONT Nils Gislesen seems to have been merged incorrectly several times.  He still has many alternate names and spouses and children that suggest this.  
1 CONT 
1 CONT The previous vital information (birth of 1548 in Middelfart, Odense and death 8 Sept 1583 in Ringsted, Sorø, Denmark) is not his, but pertains to an Iver Bertelsen, with whom Nils was incorrectly merged at some point.  As near as I can tell from s
1 CONC ome of the notes here, Nils was Norwegian and lived in the first half of the 17th century.
1 CONT 
1 CONT I have removed as much of Iver's information from Nils as I could find.
1 CONT 
1 CONT If you look in the "show all changes" section, you can see that at some point, someone deleted what look like all of Nils' actual children, because they were born in the early 1600s and Nils had Ivers' death date of 1583.
